    "type": 0,
    "content": "To successfully keep a sizable inventory you should have:\n- Bag sizes of at least 15 per slot\n- At least 1 Invisible bag filled with items you frequently use or drop from your main game mode, and are marketable, depositable, or salvageable\n- Open all bags possible\n- Ask yourself \"do I really need that account bound thing?\"\n\nHere's a video guide of <@300712435478953984> walking through sorting the inventory of his one characters, and explaining why he makes the decisions he does:\nhttps://youtu.be/UqFGu2yDqks",
